@page "/support"
<PageTitle>Support & Contact</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <header class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-primary">Support & Contact</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted">We're here to help you forge the future of logic.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card p-4 shadow-lg mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">
        <div class="card-body text-center">

            <h2 class="h5 mb-4">Immediate Assistance</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">
                For technical questions regarding the **FSM\_API**, partnership inquiries, or general support, please reach out directly via email.
            </p>

            <a href="mailto:support@thesingularityworkshop.com" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mb-4">
                <span class="oi oi-envelope-closed" aria-hidden="true"></span> Email Support Now
            </a>

            <h2 class="h5 mt-5 mb-3 text-secondary">Future Contact Form (FSM Integration)</h2>
            <p class="text-muted small">
                This area is reserved for our state-driven contact form. We plan to use our own **FSM\_API** and **FSMManagerService** to handle form validation, submission sequencing, and UI feedback, demonstrating our technology in action.
            </p>
            <div class="border p-3 bg-light text-center text-secondary fst-italic">
                [Contact Form FSM Logic Pending Development]
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 text-center">
        <h3 class="h6 text-muted">Legal Compliance Notice</h3>
        <p class="small text-muted">
            For terms and policies, please visit our dedicated pages:
            <a href="privacy-policy" class="text-decoration-none mx-2">Privacy Policy</a> |
            <a href="terms-of-service" class="text-decoration-none mx-2">Terms of Service</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>